    "Id": "chassisdef_battlemaster_BLR-QS2",
    "Name": "BattleMaster",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Assault PPC Brawler. The BLR-QS2 brings to bear a surprising amount of firepower for a mech so heavily armored. Thanks to our patented XL ICE technology, your brand new battery of PPCs will stay cool as ICE!\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>",
